parseRow('1,"Smith, Ana"'); // ['1', 'Smith, Ana']
parseRow('a,"say ""hi"""'); // ['a', 'say "hi"']
parseRow('a,'); // ['a', '']
```

Every parsed value is a **string**; convert numbers and dates yourself. Splitting the file on `\n` first breaks quoted fields that contain newlines, which is one reason to use a library (e.g. Papa Parse) for real uploads.

