// { name: 'Ann', email: 'ann@example.com', age: '31' }

zipObject(['a', 'b', 'c'], [1, 2]); // { a: 1, b: 2, c: undefined }
zipObject(['a', 'b'], [1, 2, 3]);   // { a: 1, b: 2 }
```

The older equivalent is `props.reduce((obj, prop, i) => ((obj[prop] = values[i]), obj), {})`. Note that parsed CSV values are still strings (`'31'`), so convert numbers yourself.

