// '&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot;&gt;Me &amp; you&lt;/a&gt;'
```

Escaping quotes matters when the value goes inside an attribute (`title="..."`). Better still, avoid building HTML strings: set `element.textContent`, or let React/your template engine escape for you, which they do by default.

