Adapted from [30 seconds of code](https://github.com/30-seconds/30-seconds-of-code/blob/f1b2d5a65c32432a877de94a749be40a396ebed2/content/snippets/js/s/encodeuri-encodeuricomponent.md) · [CC BY 4.0](/licenses/30-seconds.txt).

