  it('lowercases and joins words with hyphens', () => {
    expect(slugify('Hello World')).toBe('hello-world');
  });
  it('removes punctuation', () => {
    expect(slugify('Hi, there!')).toBe('hi-there');
  });
  it('never returns leading or trailing hyphens', () => {
    expect(slugify('  Hi  ')).toBe('hi');
  });
});
```

The list is only as good as the cases on it: a behavior with no test isn't covered. The payoff is visible progress in short sessions, since each passing test is a finished step.

