An extremely cool and modern effect is to rotate and zoom in on an image when hovering over it. All it takes is a container (e.g. a `<figure>`) with an image inside and a few lines of CSS.

To achieve the desired effect, simply use the `scale()` and `rotate()` functions in the `transform` property of the image. Then, use the `transition` property to animate the transformation when hovering over the parent element.

Add `overflow: hidden` to the parent element to hide the excess from the image transformation. You can also set a `min-width`, `max-width`, and `width` to control the size of the container.

```html
<figure class="hover-rotate">
  <img src="/path/to/your/img.jpg"/>
</figure>
```

```css
.hover-rotate {
  overflow: hidden;
  min-width: 240px;
  max-width: 320px;
  width: 100%;
}

.hover-rotate img {
  transition: all 0.3s;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  max-width: 100%;
}

.hover-rotate:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.3) rotate(5deg);
}
```

---
Adapted from [30 seconds of code](https://github.com/30-seconds/30-seconds-of-code/blob/f1b2d5a65c32432a877de94a749be40a396ebed2/content/snippets/css/s/image-hover-rotate.md) · [CC BY 4.0](/licenses/30-seconds.txt).

back:
The wrapper has `overflow: hidden`, which clips the enlarged image to the wrapper's box. The image doesn't push neighbors because transforms only change how the element is painted: its layout box keeps its original size and position.

```css
.hover-rotate {
  overflow: hidden;       /* clip the transformed image */
  max-width: 320px;
}

.hover-rotate img {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}

.hover-rotate:hover img {
  transform: scale(1.3) rotate(5deg);
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .hover-rotate img { transition: none; }
}
```

The same wrapper-with-`overflow: hidden` + transformed child pattern is used for zoom-on-hover product thumbnails. If the wrapper has `border-radius`, the clipping follows the rounded corners.

---
Adapted from [30 seconds of code](https://github.com/30-seconds/30-seconds-of-code/blob/f1b2d5a65c32432a877de94a749be40a396ebed2/content/snippets/css/s/image-hover-rotate.md) · [CC BY 4.0](/licenses/30-seconds.txt).

