.truncate {
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.row { display: flex; }
.row .name {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;     /* allow shrinking so truncation can happen */
}
```

This is a classic bug in table-like list rows (a user name next to action buttons). Put the full text in a `title` attribute or show it elsewhere, so truncated values stay available.

