Use the `-webkit-line-clamp` pattern: `display: -webkit-box`, `-webkit-box-orient: vertical`, `-webkit-line-clamp: 3`, and `overflow: hidden`. `text-overflow: ellipsis` doesn't work across multiple lines, so this is the way to get "…" at the end of line 3. Despite the prefixes, it is standardized for compatibility and works in all modern browsers.

