.card-description {
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
  overflow: hidden;
}
```

The unprefixed `line-clamp` property is specified but not yet reliably supported, so use the prefixed form. The full text is still in the DOM and read by screen readers; provide a "Read more" link or the full text on the detail page.

