}
```

If you also set text from code (e.g. loading a draft), `maxLength` doesn't trim it, so clip it yourself: `setText(s.slice(0, limit))`. Gotcha: `length` and `maxLength` count UTF-16 code units, so an emoji like 👍 counts as 2. Always re-check the limit on the server; the browser limit is only a convenience.

